<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="d313aA" xml:lang="en">
   <title>Preview Reconciliation</title>
   <prolog>
      <author>Jessica Halbhuber</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Jul 17, 2024"/>
      </critdates>
      <metadata>
         <prodinfo>
            <prodname>X-Author for Contracts Advanced</prodname>
         </prodinfo>
      </metadata>
   </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>The preview reconciliation feature allows you to preview the difference between the current or modified value in the document and the Conga CLM values. The following tasks are available for reconciliation:</p>
      <ul>
         <li>Modify a smart field</li>
         <li>Mark a field</li>
         <li>Mark a field for removal</li>
         <li>Modify a marked field</li>
         <li>Modify a smart clause</li>
         <li>Insert as a smart clause</li>
         <li>Modify a marked clause</li>
         <li>Mark a clause for deletion</li>
      </ul>
   </conbody>
</concept>